# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# --- Secrets: never commit these ----------------------------------------------
# Local keys (.env.local etc.). The deployed app gets keys from GitHub Secrets.
.env*
!.env.example
# Private keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
# Vercel project link (created by `vercel link`, contains org/project IDs)
.vercel
# Supabase CLI local state
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# --- Dependencies ----------------------------------------------------------------
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# --- Build output --------------------------------------------------------------
/.next/
/out/
/build
/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# --- Logs ------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- OS / editor files ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
